  "body": [
    "Home",
    "Unlock the efficiency your business is missing",
    "Experiences too slow; Marketing ops too manual; commerce stuck in silos. We’ll help you fix it — fast.",
    "Doing more with less isn’t new. It’s business as usual now.",
    "Digital leaders are being asked to go faster, personalize more and reduce costs, all while their teams are buried in manual tasks and legacy tools. Add AI and rising customer expectations into the mix and things only get more complex.",
    "We get it. And we can help.",
    "Valtech and Adobe have teamed up to cut through the complexity and deliver what matters. From strategy and discovery to implementation and optimization, we help deliver measurable results at speed and scale – boosted by AI.",
    "We’ve seen it before. And we’ve fixed it before.",
    "Your teams might be stuck in slow workflows, tools that don't talk to each other, or platforms that can't keep up. You're not alone. These are the blockers holding businesses back:",
    "Disconnected tools, teams and workflows",
    "Disconnected tools, teams and workflows",
    "Pressure to personalize with limited resources",
    "Pressure to personalize with limited resources",
